[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m ### Step 3: Use the divisibility condition
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m Let $ d = b + 7 $, so we want $ d \mid 9b + 7 $. Since $ d = b + 7 $, we can write:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m b = d - 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m Now substitute into $ 9b + 7 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 9b + 7 = 9(d - 7) + 7 = 9d - 63 + 7 = 9d - 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m We are to find when $ d \mid 9d - 56 $, which is equivalent to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m d \mid (9d - 56) - 9d = -56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m So we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m d \mid -56 \Rightarrow d \mid 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m So $ d = b + 7 $ must be a **positive divisor of 56**, and also $ b > 9 \Rightarrow d > 16 $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m ### Step 4: Find divisors of 56 greater than 16
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m Find all positive divisors of 56:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m \text{Divisors of 56: } \{1, 2, 4, 7, 8, 14, 28, 56\}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
