[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m Then $ b = d - 7 $, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m - $ d = 28 \Rightarrow b = 28 - 7 = 21 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m - $ d = 56 \Rightarrow b = 56 - 7 = 49 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m So the valid bases are $ b = 21 $ and $ b = 49 $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m ### Step 5: Sum the valid bases
[36m(TaskRunner pid=220632)[0m 
